{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演三日目、終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2012/09/05/%E3%81%88%E3%81%A8%E3%81%86%EF%BC%93.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も舞台裏では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの涙がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく頑張った、よく頑張ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違和感あるって言ってた時から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足の指の事は知っていましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"骨折と聞いたとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にびっくりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痛いのめっちゃ我慢して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って躍ってたんやな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく勇気のいる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決断だったとおもいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いと思うけど今は安静にして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく早く治ってほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉、ゆきな、ひなちま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、ねね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部出たくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出れないメンバーも居ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今まで 1st ,2nd ,3rd と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとアンダーだったからこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージで歌って踊れない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらさや悔しい気持ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に分かります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立って歌うことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに幸せかも分かります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日私は 昨日と同じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13位という順位をもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を選んでくれた157人の方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が二幕に出ることができたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ 私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この16人に選ばれた時には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出れないメンバーの分まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯 一生懸命頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立てることは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前じゃないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立てることの幸せを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噛み締めて踊ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージで誰よりも輝きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとたくさんの人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの事を見てもらいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は興味がなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり知らなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演に来て、ちょっとでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいなって思ってもらいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の自分のパフォーマンスには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん全然満足していません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからそう思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと自分を出していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}